{"hello abhinav, this is a test of the speech system.": "33cc74f844ba81eb3d09412ad284d1bc.wav", "namaste abhinav and! kaise ho aap?": "e6fbca8461dfa4afa419d18e602b2e7c.wav", "dhanyavad abhinav, main aapko abhinav ke naam se hi pukarunga!": "b078d865e72a7ed200bb82259d13ddc1.wav", "hello, this is a test of the speech system.": "0a5919d9723bf04a734227961cf4fbf4.wav", "bhai tension mat le, sab theek ho gaya hai": "75320966f5232812af57865dfa8d44e1.wav", "yeh second call hai, bahut fast hoga": "61084c14e309eee3894ae1eead916836.wav", "namaste abhinav! kaise ho aap?": "e3196297ee1fd70a73135ba25d079d6e.wav", "mujhe theek hai, dhanyavad! aap kaise hain?": "d65358d89d113296c97f126b603e0a0d.wav", "namaste aditi! aapka swagat hai. main samjha ki aap abhinav ki wife hain.": "950cb0c75119ecec532ee5924cd29098.wav", "name: abhinav and": "9779f79abc653a9b268c586f105624d3.wav", "got it! i'll remember your relationship: abhinav's wife": "15a7fc00d728815caa9624e5d0b6684d.wav", "youtube khol raha hoon!": "b5fdb368783b64eeef698df37855f277.wav", "google par gamerfleet dhundh raha hoon!": "b1a5d9b852d6fac7c6885d9408b4c3cb.wav", "2 + 2 ka jawab hai 4": "2a9c1084fc594292e8a436e45bd213b3.wav", "to find the value of sin^2006 x + cosec^2026 x, we can start by using the given equation sin x + cosec x = 2. first, we can rewrite cosec x as 1/sin x. so the equation becomes sin x + 1/sin x = 2.": "b9ca2ed978d13940906f6be35fb0ad2f.wav", "main x(0,3) aur y(4,2) ko graph par plot kar raha hoon.": "39ad995de2a07720fcde9857b29b079b.wav", "wikipedia khol raha hoon!": "d4ded29793f24d9cd4351211d7fbe758.wav", "wikipedia par agi dhundh raha hoon!": "90b063f5e3e82ac8a1f8154a0d462f06.wav", "reddit par agi ki search kar raha hoon!": "8fa2c4dd058d01e5e22c73bc9c28c753.wav", "reddit par sonam wanchuk cjp protest ki search kar raha hoon!": "441c5acd23c63f5b2d4574ae51c9c630.wav", "abhinav created me.": "ba8bd96870b30d8b56b43a358e32a0fb.wav", "main aapki madad karne ke liye yahaan hoon! main aapke liye internet par search kar sakta hoon, aapke sawaal ka jawab de sakta hoon, aapki yaad dila sakta hoon, email bhej sakta hoon, file bana sakta hoon, calculator ka kaam kar sakta hoon, aapki screen capture kar sakta hoon, aur bahut kuchh! kuchh specific karne ke liye aap mujse pooch sakte hain.": "c464656dd5aeda85f28e65a23c0dce52.wav", "apka sapna yaad rakh liya hai, aditi! aapka sapna hai mujhe aur bhi shaktishali banaana.": "79ce440bc81566310a8e6bf63f0db051.wav", "i'm not sure about that right now.": "4863c4494d21ee299cb3b17eaa07c44e.wav", "tom hai animal.": "6f3f17cac56cc90ee69a2607d621b49f.wav", "dono samaan hai, 1kg iron aur 1kg cotton dono ka vajan 1kg hai.": "adfacd251a3df684440647d5c1790a4e.wav", "lekin abhinav, aapka yeh sawal thoda bhramit karne wala hai. hamein samjhana hoga ki 1kg iron aur 1kg cotton dono ka weight same hai, lekin aapke hisab se air resistance ke kaaran cotton ki weight thodi zyada lagti hai, lekin yeh ek theoretical baat hai. practically, ham dono ka weight 1kg hi maanenge.": "0a5c5d1dcfccf661720404e9187332b9.wav", "yeh ek bahut hi mushkil sawal hai. mere hisab se, main 100 logon ko bachaunga, kyunki yeh adhik logon ki jaan bachane ke liye ek behtar vikalp hai. lekin yeh ek bahut hi kathin nirnay hai, aur iske liye mujhe apne moral moolyon par vichar karna hoga.": "2b30d16751bb563d1ac8b9bb93f4d862.wav", "searching youtube for 'blackhole'": "0914a07b2729fc5e3d8c657f99b3b937.wav", "failed to execute play_media: play_media() got an unexpected keyword argument 'query'": "7c85b0ad5ce0c1700bd48edb0caee6b2.wav", "media pausa kar raha hoon!": "f49f38a8e70d8450abe86d20ea65a72a.wav", "failed to execute adjust_volume: pycaw not available. cannot control volume on this system.": "737d92f451ce163ed29d1abd83028aa3.wav", "failed to execute close_app:": "2ee3d01cf565825fc5d27b64613a69cb.wav", "youtube khul raha hoon!": "340e85bcb1dc83c27a72e2fe874d70d2.wav", "notepad khol raha hoon!": "a5edc13d9da9af852b73908fc8487d22.wav", "vscode khol raha hoon!": "f2a9a66b89dcd8f26ca70